nt=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/120px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"196\" /></span></span></span>\n</p>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<p>此北宋作品在全世界都属于<b><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AC%E6%9C%89%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:公有领域\">公有领域</a></b>，因为作者逝世已经超过100年，且作品于1931年1月1日之前出版。\n</p>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<p><span class=\"noimageRight\"></span>\n</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"licensetpl\">\n<p><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;link&#95;req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;attr&#95;req\">false</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">聖文章武孝皇帝　本史卷八及薛史卷七五晉高祖紀、五代會要卷一、通鑑二八０均作「聖文章武明德孝皇帝」。</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">永清軍節度梁漢璋　「清」，各本原作「靜」。薛史卷九五梁漢璋傳及通鑑卷二八五俱稱梁漢璋為永清軍節度使；薛史卷八四晉少帝紀又云以漢璋為貝州節度使。查本史卷六０職方考，貝州後晉時正為永清軍。據改。</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.eqiad.main‐864d949c75‐rzkh9\nCached time: 20260911081110\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Template:PD‐old (currentyear)\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.121 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.158 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 260/1000000\nRevision size: 11242/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 11006/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1603/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post